<title>DUBAI: TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results of the $1</p>
<p>million Dubai Tennis Open on Monday:</p>
<p>Martin Sinner (Germany) beat Tim Henman (Britain) 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat James Sekulov (Australia) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
